Thu Oct  8 18:29:36 UTC 2026 - tokajer <tokajer@tokajer.at>

- Initial package: Calamares configuration for the NazoOS live medium
  * btrfs only, openSUSE subvolume layout below @, no swap partition
  * Snapper config, / follows the btrfs default subvolume (rollback)
  * GRUB with shim via perl-Bootloader, snapshot boot entries
  * NazoOS installer branding and slideshow
  * Removes live-only packages and itself from the installed system
